### Seed Endpoint Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@devToolsUrl = http://localhost:8082/serverpod_dev_tools/api

### 1. Seed Sample Authors and Articles (Serverpod RPC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "seedSampleData",
  "clearExisting": true
}

### 2. Get Current Database Stats
POST {{baseUrl}}/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "getDatabaseStats"
}

### 3. Clear Sample Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "clearSampleData"
}

### 4. Call Seed via Serverpod DevTools WebServer REST Invoke API
POST {{devToolsUrl}}/invoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "seed",
  "method": "seedSampleData",
  "parameters": {
    "clearExisting": false
  }
}

### 5. Inspect Seeded Authors in DevTools Live Database Browser
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/data?table=author

### 6. Inspect Seeded Articles in DevTools Live Database Browser
GET {{devToolsUrl}}/data?table=article
